== Puncturing can destroy the MINIMUM distance of C (not used in the note, but needed
   for any argument that wants the basins of nu_{C,b} to be distinguishable):
  simplex[15,4,8] restricted to 8 coordinates (zero set of a word + 1): dim 4 min weight 1 dual distance 3
